{"id":"geradezu","lemma":"geradezu","pos":"adv","rank":4482,"glosses":["downright","almost"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/De-geradezu.ogg/De-geradezu.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Unsere Flucht war geradezu ein Wunder.","en":"Our escape was nothing short of a miracle.","words":[{"g":"our","l":"unser"},{"g":"line, alignment"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"miracle"}]},{"text":"Dieser Film war geradezu langweilig.","en":"That movie was really boring.","words":[{"g":"this one, this"},{"g":"film"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"boring, dull, tedious"}]},{"text":"Ich habe Ihre Gegenwart geradezu genossen.","en":"I really enjoyed your company.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"the present"},null,{"g":"partner in something","l":"Genosse"}]},{"text":"Es scheint geradezu, als stünde der ganze Himmel in Flammen.","en":"It is as if the whole sky were on fire.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to shine","l":"scheinen"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"to flame"}]},{"text":"Tom ist geradezu ein Bruder mit einem Beschützerwahn.","en":"Tom is an overprotective brother.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},null]}]}